      {
        "number": 4,
        "title": "A useful idea",
        "narrative": "The girl thought about neighbours reading after dark. In her imaginary adventure, her glow could help. In everyday life, safe rechargeable lamps could help too.",
        "illustrationDescription": "Neighbours discussing rechargeable reading lamps in a community room.",
        "characterRefs": [
          "girl"
        ],
        "learningMoment": "Real communities can plan safe sources of light together.",
        "translation": {
          "text": "Ngoanana o ile a nahana ka baahisani ba balang ha ho se ho le lefifi. Leetong la hae la boinahanelo, khanya ea hae e ne e ka thusa. Bophelong ba letsatsi le letsatsi, mabone a bolokehileng a ka tjhajoang hape le ’ona a ne a ka thusa.",
