      {
        "number": 5,
        "title": "Stories together",
        "narrative": "That evening, families met to read. Adults set out charged lamps. In the story, the girl's little glow joined them. Everyone had a place around the table.",
        "illustrationDescription": "Families reading together with enclosed rechargeable lamps and a small imaginary glow.",
        "characterRefs": [
          "girl"
        ],
        "learningMoment": "Shared resources can help people learn together.",
        "translation": {
          "text": "Mantsiboeeng ao, malapa a ile a kopana ho bala. Batho ba baholo ba ile ba beha mabone a tjhajiloeng. Paleng, khanya e nyenyane ea ngoanana e ile ea ikopanya le ’ona. E mong le e mong o ne a e-na le sebaka haufi le tafole.",
