    {
      "id": "st-page-01",
      "language": "st",
      "kind": "page",
      "page": 1,
      "maxSeconds": 60,
      "text": "Ha mabone a tima, ngoanana o ile a inahanela khanya e nyenyane ka holim'a letsoho la hae. E ne e le matla a bukeng ea lipale, eseng ntho eo batho ba ka e etsang bophelong ba sebele.",
      "version": 1,
      "status": "approved",
      "source": {
        "assetId": "translation-10db2c10-a553-48a1-b7c9-dd10a0fd2d9f-1",
        "providerId": "openai",
        "model": "gpt-5.6-terra",
        "origin": "generated",
        "editedByCreator": false
      },
      "history": [],
      "flags": [
        "Power interruption/load-shedding, imagined glow, fiction versus real life",
        "storybook power: A fictional/supernatural ability in a story, not a real human ability; check the preferred child-friendly Sesotho wording.",
        "glow: A soft light or shine; check whether “khanya” gives the intended gentle-light meaning."
      ],
      "recordingHistory": [],
      "clip": {
        "id": "17fbff60-e3a2-432a-85ba-458ed8ee0405",
        "scriptVersion": 1,
        "sha256": "2ee0e8ae304a614e48fd9baadbcd4e4746ef662b9e31e9e332e43348c912b36e",
        "seconds": 29.592,
        "approved": true,
        "adultOwnVoice": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "st-page-02",
      "language": "st",
      "kind": "page",
      "page": 2,
      "maxSeconds": 60,
      "text": "Sekolong, o ile a botsa hore na lebone le ka khanya joang. Tichere ea hae e ile ea tlisa sete e nyenyane ea libeteri ea tlelaseng. Ha ho motho ea ileng a ama sokete ea leboteng kapa terata e hlephileng.",
      "version": 1,
      "status": "approved",
      "source": {
        "assetId": "translation-10db2c10-a553-48a1-b7c9-dd10a0fd2d9f-2",
        "providerId": "openai",
        "model": "gpt-5.6-terra",
        "origin": "generated",
        "editedByCreator": false
      },
      "history": [],
      "flags": [
        "Battery learning kit, wall socket/mains, loose wire",
        "battery kit: A small classroom set of batteries and parts for learning; check the most natural Sesotho term.",
        "wall socket: The electrical outlet fixed to a wall; check the preferred term for “sokete” in South African Sesotho.",
        "loose wire: A wire that is not securely connected and may be unsafe; safety meaning must remain clear."
      ],
      "recordingHistory": [],
      "clip": {
        "id": "67a0ffcf-36ac-4dff-a5c9-a9b84eefbafc",
        "scriptVersion": 1,
        "sha256": "02410eecf9c32597dfc0f6872f52b55c641c9661424860899157db5edf5d3547",
        "seconds": 35.832,
        "approved": true,
        "adultOwnVoice": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "st-page-03",
      "language": "st",
      "kind": "page",
      "page": 3,
      "maxSeconds": 60,
      "text": "Tichere e ile ea koala switjhe ea sete eo. Lebone la eona le lenyenyane la khanya. Tichere e ile ea hlalosa hore potoloho e feletseng e etsa tsela eo motlakase oa motlakase o fetang ho eona.",
      "version": 1,
      "status": "approved",
      "source": {
        "assetId": "translation-10db2c10-a553-48a1-b7c9-dd10a0fd2d9f-3",
        "providerId": "openai",
        "model": "gpt-5.6-terra",
        "origin": "generated",
        "editedByCreator": false
      },
      "history": [],
      "flags": [
        "Switch, complete circuit, electric current",
        "switch: The control that opens or closes an electrical circuit; check whether “switjhe” is the preferred learner-friendly term.",
        "complete circuit: An unbroken electrical path that allows current to flow; science meaning needs checking.",
        "electric current: The flow of electricity through a circuit; the Sesotho wording should be checked for scientific accuracy."
      ],
      "recordingHistory": [],
      "clip": {
        "id": "297f86e9-06be-481b-927d-a2667d844da0",
        "scriptVersion": 1,
        "sha256": "9c1550157833748f0b9e4fe797940c50eb01f6696c0cefaa5f0beb229ee85471",
        "seconds": 37.104,
        "approved": true,
        "adultOwnVoice": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "st-page-04",
      "language": "st",
      "kind": "page",
      "page": 4,
      "maxSeconds": 60,
      "text": "Ngoanana o ile a nahana ka baahisani ba balang ha ho se ho le lefifi. Leetong la hae la boinahanelo, khanya ea hae e ne e ka thusa. Bophelong ba letsatsi le letsatsi, mabone a bolokehileng a ka tjhajoang hape le ’ona a ne a ka thusa.",
      "version": 1,
      "status": "approved",
      "source": {
        "assetId": "translation-10db2c10-a553-48a1-b7c9-dd10a0fd2d9f-4",
        "providerId": "openai",
        "model": "gpt-5.6-terra",
        "origin": "generated",
        "editedByCreator": false
      },
      "history": [],
      "flags": [
        "Imaginary adventure, safe rechargeable lamps",
        "neighbours: People living nearby; check whether “baahisani” is the preferred term for the intended age group.",
        "imaginary adventure: A make-believe adventure; check the most natural child-friendly Sesotho phrasing.",
        "glow: A soft fictional light; check whether “khanya” preserves this meaning.",
        "rechargeable: Able to be charged again for reuse; check the clearest Sesotho wording."
      ],
      "recordingHistory": [],
      "clip": {
